id: terrifying-presence
name: Terrifying Presence
talentCategory: skill
prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Intimidation Skill
description: >
  Your ability to inspire fear in your enemies is truly astounding.
text: >
  Terrifying Presence: Your ability to inspire fear in your enemies is truly astounding.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Intimidation Skill
  (1)-[Passive]: When you use the Terrify Maneuver, you can target all Opponents within a Sphere AoE centered on you, or target a single Opponent up to 8 Squares away from you.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you knock an Opponent through a Health Threshold, you may use the Terrify Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# (1) The Terrify at every Opponent targeted - who stands within the Sphere, the table's: a Clash at each (use-maneuver.mjs). A
# single one up to 8 Squares away needs nothing: no distance is measured for it.
[passive]
allow terrify.presence;

# (2) An Opponent knocked through a Health Threshold by you: the Terrify out of sequence, offered on your latest card - never
# Automatic, it hands over an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver (chat.mjs terrifyingPresence).
[triggered/knock-through, 1/round, outOfSequence, effect 2]
terrifyingPresence();
